  },
  {
   "text": "A pearl is made of nacre, which is layered aragonite crystal.",
   "say": "A pearl is made of nay-ker, which is layered uh-rag-uh-nite crystal.",
   "scene": {
    "kind": "photo",
    "src": "earrings-render.webp",
    "label": "Nacre",
    "focus": {
     "x": 0.46,
     "y": 0.75,
     "k": 2.4
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "In a cultured pearl, the nacre grows over a shell bead.",
   "scene": {
    "kind": "photo",
    "src": "earrings-render.webp",
    "label": "A cultured pearl",
    "focus": {
     "x": 0.45,
     "y": 0.72,
     "k": 1.4
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Each crystal plate is about half a micrometer thick.",
   "say": "Each crystal plate is about half a micrometer thick.",
   "scene": {
    "kind": "title",
    "text": "0.5 µm",
    "sub": "One crystal plate"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Light bounces off the surface and off the layers beneath it.",
   "scene": {
    "kind": "photo",
    "src": "earrings-render.webp",
    "label": "Light in the layers",
    "focus": {
     "x": 0.44,
     "y": 0.72,
     "k": 3.0
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "That glow is called luster.",
   "scene": {
    "kind": "compare",
    "before": "earrings-input.webp",
    "after": "earrings-render.webp",
    "beforeLabel": "3D file",
    "afterLabel": "Luster"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "Jewelers judge it by how sharp and bright its reflections are.",
   "scene": {
    "kind": "photo",
    "src": "earrings-render.webp",
    "label": "Sharp reflection",
    "focus": {
     "x": 0.42,
     "y": 0.7,
     "k": 3.4
    }
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "An Akoya pearl needs at least ten months to grow those layers.",
   "say": "An Ah-koh-yah pearl needs at least ten months to grow those layers.",
   "scene": {
    "kind": "title",
    "text": "10 months",
    "sub": "An Akoya pearl, at least"
   }
  },
  {
   "text": "So the glow is built one thin layer at a time.",
   "scene": {
